{
  "repo": "EH3D-IOS-CONTROL",
  "ecosystem": "eh3d",
  "tagline": "The iPhone app that follows the Bungard machines of a workshop through EH3D-SERVER.",
  "description": "EH3D-IOS-CONTROL is an app in Swift and SwiftUI, in the Forge theme of the EH3D programs, the twin of EH3D-ANDROID-CONTROL. It signs in to an EH3D-SERVER, reads the fleet, the jobs and the drill head every second and a half, draws the job in 2D and isometric views with the place of the head, stops a machine (asking twice) or confirms the step a job waits for, and shows the camera of the drill head that the server relays. The rules are in the Swift package Eh3dCore and are tested without a phone; the screens are built with Xcode and nothing has been run on a device.",
